<!-- Indonesian, LEGACY `in` bucket (byte-identical to values-id/).
     Java still reports Indonesian as the obsolete code `in`, and that is
     the code the runtime asks the resource table for, so `values-id/`
     alone silently resolves to the default (Arabic) bucket. Both are
     shipped: `id` for aapt2/locales_config, `in` for the runtime.
     Regenerate the pair together — never hand-edit one.
